%H A123461 Lawrence Ong, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.05982">Optimal Finite-Length and Asymptotic Index Codes for Five or Fewer Receivers</a>, arXiv preprint arXiv:1606.05982 [cs.IT], 2016.
